<description>&lt;p&gt;Mali forces have retaken Kidal as jihadist attacks intensify, and a Mali drone strike killed 13 civilians while the army said it targeted militants. In Burkina Faso militants now control at least 40% of the country and a critic of Mali’s junta was forcibly disappeared, while the junta stripped five more exiled critics of nationality. In Niger a convoy carrying Governor Bago collided with a car, killing four students, a driver and a young woman, and Niger accused Chad of a drone attack that killed two civilians. Russia hosted African leaders to deepen ties, and the conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPWVZQcnVSbVZlRVVUOGd4OUdINXVJc0NPMlhwTnc3d2N1RHNNOElYb3ZjVXBWOUp0Z1I3a292M0pkVW00VWliTi1YelNmRlMtSU1vM29qVEFQek1acWxDMk1lMVRUUzBNUzhRN3BlUlY2SkRWZHA0RFBqTmtSdy1CZ05KT1Q0M1pZMW1QVTlVN0FEREhJa3g0TFphSFZuX1Jud0F1eWxkMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ACI Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxNaWxKVWFjS0cyVWZ2dnUwV2JPdS1DSHEtaUVfNVBoWGFpZFNYRU5fTGFOQW5QaktvZkFxdFhMeVJwejJ2MXZ5TVNwY0ZYXzlGdGh2SFlWUHM4WHRDT1p4TmNCb3BiQTRGaWpBdk8ySFY3NE9HVkp0MVNaTzc4SnFYaDI1YTR6Rkh5MzFjN0plR1NGSUhMcWFJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Human Rights Watch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQV3lsSUpsbEVMTUhFU1hDWGNEZkF1bWNCdlZpbm9pSEplZmlkZkRicHpJd3BaakNBQmt5ZWZickpoSTNzYk41UFdkcms4SThlRHY0c2NTdjFUMEJwUDM3OGNHR09xTUMyakJYbVlaS2hidXpoV1JIMTZiUlFkX3pPb0xEN1ZFdUoydktvR0pObEpvM1dhUVJSdThhV1BEdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;National Security News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNNjlQNzF6MURVMFl2Q0FSZ09oR1owODZOdTdaX0JpZWlCeVZLclExMDQ0dUdfRnVxTE1YN0tQYnZ2VDBZQW1TampTSVZURHlWUzNfRV